.TH ZERODDS-MQTT-BRIDGED.YAML 5 "2026-05-06" "1.0.0-rc.1" "ZeroDDS Manual"
.SH NAME
zerodds-mqtt-bridged.yaml \- configuration file for zerodds-mqtt-bridged(1)
.SH KEYS
.SS participant
.B domain_id ", " qos_profile .
.SS mqtt
.TP
.B broker_url
URL of the MQTT broker, e.g.
.IR mqtts://broker.example:8883 .
.TP
.B client_id
MQTT client identifier; must be globally unique.
.TP
.B username ", " password_file
SASL credentials. Password is read from the file with mode 0600.
.TP
.B tls
.B enabled ", " ca ", " cert ", " key .
.TP
.B keepalive_secs ", " session_expiry_secs
MQTT 5 session-handling.
.SS routes (list)
.B dds_topic ", " type ", " mqtt_topic ", " direction ", " mqtt_qos
(0|1|2),
.B retain ", " expiry_secs ", " content_type
(optional).
.SS logging ", " observability
identical to other ZeroDDS bridge configs.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zerodds-mqtt-bridged (1),
.BR zerodds-xml-config (1).
